ount\">17</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"key-themes\">\n                        <div class=\"key-themes-title\">🔥 Top Themes This Week:</div>\n                        <div class=\"theme-item\">• AI Economics & Enterprise Costs</div>\n                        <div class=\"theme-item\">• AI Security & Vulnerabilities</div>\n                        <div class=\"theme-item\">• Education & Skills Impact</div>\n                        <div class=\"theme-item\">• AI Research & Development</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"content-item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/06/05/the-token-bill-comes-due-inside-the-industry-scramble-to-manage-ais-runaway-costs/\">The token bill comes due: Inside the industry scramble to manage AI's runaway costs</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"author\">\n                            <span>By Lorenzo Franceschi-Bicchierai</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-badge techcrunch\">TechCrunch</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"description\">TechCrunch investigates how companies are struggling to manage spiraling AI infrastructure costs, with Uber and others implementing usage caps and cost controls.</div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"topic\">AI Economics</span>\n                            <span class=\"topic\">Enterprise AI</span>\n                            <span class=\"topic\">LLM Pricing</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"content-item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/5/andreas-kling/\">Andreas Kling on Changing How We Develop Ladybird</a>\n                 