lasses</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"author\">\n                            <span>By Daily Cal</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-badge hn\">HN</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"description\">UC Berkeley reports significant increase in failing grades correlated with AI tool usage, raising concerns about foundational skills erosion in computer science education.</div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"topic\">AI Education</span>\n                            <span class=\"topic\">Academic Integrity</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"content-item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/3/uber-caps-usage/\">Uber Caps Usage of AI Tools Like Claude Code to Manage Costs</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"author\">\n                            <span>By Simon Willison</span>\n                            <span class=\"source-badge blog\">Blog</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"description\">Uber implements usage caps on AI coding tools like Claude Code to manage costs, highlighting the economic realities of AI tool adoption at scale.</div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"topic\">AI Economics</span>\n                            <span class=\"topic\">Coding Agents</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"content-item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://maxleiter.com/blog/weights\">They're made out of weights</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"author\">\n